      "text": "你的天同得祿，又稍見煞星，意志反而堅強。",
      "en": "Your Tian Tong gains Lu and meets a touch of malefics, which actually strengthens your will.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.星系48.2",
        "quote": "必须稍见一二点煞曜，然后始主意志坚强"
      },
      "pole": "意志堅強"
    },
    {
      "id": "天同巳亥.祿無煞",
      "role": "limit",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "any": [
              {
                "hua": "祿",
                "star": "天同",
                "at": "same"
              },
              {
                "star": "祿存",
                "at": "same"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": [
                "擎羊",
                "陀羅",
                "火星",
                "鈴星",
                "地空",
                "地劫"
              ],
              "at": "sifang"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "你的天同得祿而不見煞，容易流於意志薄弱。",
      "en": "Your Tian Tong gains Lu with no malefics in view, so your will can slide into weakness.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.星系48.2",
        "quote": "否则可能沦为意志薄弱"
      },
      "pole": "意志薄弱"
    },
    {
      "id": "天同巳亥.權",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
