        "star": "天同",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "你的天同化權，意志堅強：情緒受到管束，天份因此得以發揮。",
      "en": "Your Tian Tong is transformed by Quan, which makes your will strong: emotions held in check let your talent come through.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.星系48.3",
        "quote": "因而得以发挥其天份的象征"
      },
      "pole": "意志堅強"
    },
    {
      "id": "天同巳亥.馬陀",
      "role": "limit",
      "when": {
        "star": [
          "天馬",
          "陀羅"
        ],
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "你的天同與天馬或陀羅同宮，至少主毅力不足。",
      "en": "Your Tian Tong shares the palace with Tian Ma or Tuo Luo, which at the least means staying power falls short.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.星系48.4",
        "quote": "至少亦主毅力不足"
      },
      "pole": "意志薄弱"
    },
    {
      "id": "天同巳亥.意志",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "lean": "意志薄弱"
      },
      "text": "這裡說的意志薄弱，不一定是沒有毅力；有時只是創業的魄力不足，或者喜歡四處漂泊。",
      "en": "Weak will here doesn't necessarily mean no staying power; sometimes it only means less drive to build something, or a love of wandering.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.星系48.5",
        "quote": "便仅指创兴事业的魄力"
